{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"peacockish-sombre-armyworm","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Same class as [rebar:a371-fb42-32c5-48bd] (an `importorskip`-masked test that is broken the\nmoment its extra IS installed). Found while running the full unit suite with the `[ui]` extra\ninstalled to verify a371's fix.\n\n`tests/unit/test_path_injection_guards.py:147`\n`test_rerun_502_body_has_no_exception_detail` builds a fake request as:\n\n    req = types.SimpleNamespace(\n        app=types.SimpleNamespace(state=types.SimpleNamespace(config=cfg)),\n        query_params={\"token\": \"tok\", \"change\": \"12345\"},\n    )\n    resp = asyncio.run(rerun(req))\n\n`src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:101` reads `request.headers.get(TOKEN_HEADER, \"\").strip()`, and the\nfake has no `headers`, so the test dies with:\n\n    AttributeError: 'types.SimpleNamespace' object has no attribute 'headers'\n\nReproduced deterministically at origin/main (c89a2ddcc4), py3.12, with `--extra ui` installed\n(which pulls fastapi):\n\n    pytest tests/unit/test_path_injection_guards.py -q -p no:randomly\n      -> 1 failed, 54 passed\n\nLine 148 is `pytest.importorskip(\"fastapi\")  # the reviewbot extra; absent in the lean CI\nsuite`, so the lean CI suite skips it and the breakage is invisible. As with a371, the test\nreads as covering the `/rerun` 502-body containment barrier while providing no coverage in any\nenvironment where the extra is present.\n\nPresumably the fake request stopped matching `app.rerun` when header-token auth was added to\nthat handler; the fake needs a `headers` mapping (and whatever else the current handler reads).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `pytest tests/unit/test_path_injection_guards.py` passes with the reviewbot/ui extra\n      installed\n- [ ] The test still asserts the same containment barrier (502 body carries no exception or\n      stack-trace detail) -- do not weaken it to make it pass\n- [ ] Sweep the other `importorskip`-guarded tests for the same rot, since none of them run in\n      the lean CI suite","id":"f1da-3f9d-8f64-4f4f","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"importorskip-masked: test_rerun_502_body_has_no_exception_detail fails when the reviewbot extra IS installed"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786097858666747001,"uuid":"d5882a40-857e-43a1-8eea-f46e69f9dfb1"}